<ans># Niva Bupa Health Insurance Ltd — 9MFY25 Financial Data Extraction

## Summary

Of the five requested URLs, only **one** — the statutory unaudited financial results PDF (Q3 & 9M FY25, IRDAI NL-format disclosure, Board-approved February 4, 2025) — contained quantitative financial data. The other four documents were reviewed but contain no P&L, balance sheet, or ratio data:

- **Compliance Certificate (Dec 2024):** Confirms zero physical-mode demat requests processed in Q3FY25; no financials.
- **Compliance Officer Details:** Names **Mr. Rajat Sharma**, Company Secretary (Membership No. F7069), as Compliance Officer for the quarter.
- **RTA Details:** Confirms **KFin Technologies Limited** (SEBI Regn. INR000000221) as Registrar & Transfer Agent.
- **Investor Relations index page:** Confirms availability of the FY24-25 quarterly results archive and later FY26-27 filings, but carries no standalone figures itself.

All quantitative figures below are therefore sourced from the single statutory PDF, read directly (including OCR where needed).

## Extracted 9MFY25 Financial Data (Nine Months Ended 31-Dec-2024)

