| Niva Bupa Health Insurance Ltd | 9MFY25 | Net Written Premium (NWP) | IGAAP | 3697.32 | INR_crore | Niva Bupa Statutory Unaudited Financial Results, Q3 & 9M FY25 (IRDAI NL disclosure) | https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/financial-results/2024-2025/December-31-2024.pdf | 2025-02-04 |
| Niva Bupa Health Insurance Ltd | 9MFY25 | Net Earned Premium (NEP) | IGAAP | 3367.04 | INR_crore | Niva Bupa Statutory Unaudited Financial Results, Q3 & 9M FY25, Annexure-II Segment Reporting | https://transactions.nivabupa.com/pages/doc/investor-relations/financial-results/2024-2025/December-31-2024.pdf | 2025-02-04 |
